description: Go conventions
globs: "**/*.go, **/go.mod, **/go.sum"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Go

- `gofmt` / `goimports`. Wrap errors with `%w`. Log with `slog`. Accept interfaces, return structs (1–3 methods). Unexported consts: `camelCase`.
- `os.Getenv` + fatal if required secret missing. `gosec ./...`. `context` with timeouts on outbound calls.
- Tests: table-driven `go test -race ./...`. Keep test funcs in sync with signatures.
- Interfaces defined where used. `time.ParseDuration`. Mutex/`RLock` for shared fields.
